@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Create user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "cache_test", "email": "cache@test.com"}

### 2. Get user (cache miss → DB → cache set)
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### 3. Get same user again (cache hit → no DB query)
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### 4. Update user (Load → Process → Save → cache invalidation)
PUT {{host}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "cache_test_updated", "email": "cache@test.com", "level": 1, "experience": 0, "gold": 0}

### 5. Get user after update (cache miss → fresh data from DB)
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### 6. Add gold (Load → Process → Save → cache invalidation)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/add-gold?amount=100

### 7. Get user after add-gold (cache miss → fresh data)
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### 8. Get all users (cache miss → DB → cache set with 30s TTL)
GET {{host}}/api/users

### 9. Health check (Redis status)
GET {{host}}/health

### 10. Prometheus metrics (cache hit/miss counters)
GET {{host}}/metrics
